# Dauntless Bodyguard: "As this creature enters, choose another creature you control" (CR 614.12a) and "Sacrifice this
# creature: The chosen creature gains indestructible until end of turn." On turn 3 Bot1 controls Ornithopter and Birds of
# Paradise, and Bot2 controls Llanowar Elves: the Elves are no choice ("you control"), and Bot1 chooses Ornithopter. The
# sacrifice gives Ornithopter alone indestructible (CR 702.12), not the Birds and not the Elves, and only until the turn
# ends (CR 514.2): on turn 4 it has only its flying.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Ornithopter
Birds of Paradise
Dauntless Bodyguard
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x15

